<title>USA: IPO FILING-Concentric Network Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Concentric Network Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Concentric Network Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			CNCX.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    11,700,769</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		    N/A</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  450,000 shrs Note: Certain strategic investors have agreed to purchase from Concentric, in a private placement that will occur concurrently with the closing of this offering, common shares with an aggregrate purchase price of about $15 million. Business: Based in Cupertino, Calif, Concentric provides tailored, value-added internet protocol based network services for business and consumers.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For expansion of network and data center operations, to fund operating losses and for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
